WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.931
WATCH. An ice cube changes to a liquid puddle.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:06.781
COOL. Show liquid water freezing into ice.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:11.677
EVAPORATE. Show water becoming vapour above a wet surface.

00:00:12.533 --> 00:00:16.117
CONDENSE. Show droplets appearing on the outside of a cold cup.
